{"name":"Constellation","hex":"#bccedb","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"constellation","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An arbitrary formation of stars perceived as a figure (especially one from mythology) or pattern, or a division of the sky including it, especially one officially recognized by astronomers; an asterism.\n\n Any of the 88 regions of the sky officially recognized by the International Astronomical Union, including all stars and celestial bodies in the region. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","Any of the 88 regions of the sky officially recognized by the International Astronomical Union, including all stars and celestial bodies in the region. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/constellation"}],"entries":[{"title":"Constellation","blocks":[{"text":"A constellation is an area on the celestial sphere in which a group of visible stars forms a perceived pattern or outline, typically representing an animal, mythological subject, or inanimate object."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Orion_constellation_-_Prodromus_astronomiae_1690_%285590584%29.jpg/330px-Orion_constellation_-_Prodromus_astronomiae_1690_%285590584%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constellation"},{"title":"Constellation (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Constellation is a science fiction psychological thriller television series created by Peter Harness, based on a concept by Sean Jablonski. The first season was released on 21 February 2024, beginning with the initial three episodes. It stars Noomi Rapace, Jonathan Banks, James D'Arcy, Julian Looman, Henry David, William Catlett, and Barbara Sukowa. In May 2024, the series was canceled after one season."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ca/Constellation_TV_series_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org